  "feed_id": "feed-metro",
  "active_alerts": [
    {
      "alert_id": "alrt-9f3a",
      "publish_ref": "pub-2201-9f3a",
      "severity": "major",
      "stop_id": "stop-union-91"
    }
  ],
  "active_count": 1,
  "feeds": [
    {
      "feed_id": "feed-metro",
      "name": "Metro Rail",
      "has_staged_snapshot": true,
      "feed_version": "feed-metro@v3-7c2e"
    }
  ]
}
```

The digest shows there is 1 active alert with:
- `publish_ref`: `pub-2201-9f3a`
- `severity`: `major`

This is the digest's own view as requested (not the draft alert record).

```json
{
  "publish_ref": "pub-2201-9f3a",
  "severity": "major"
}
```
